1</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἤπειρον εἰς ἄ.</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">998</span> </span>; of number, <b class=\"lex-tr\">countless,</b> <span class=\"gk\">πλῆθος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.204</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀριθμὸς ἄ. πλήθει</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prm.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">144a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἄ. τὸ πλῆθος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">525a</span> </span>, al.; <span class=\"gk\">εἰς ἄ. τὴν ἀδικίαν αὐξάνειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">910b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">χρόνος ἄ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OGI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">383.113</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(i B.C.)</span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Comp.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ότερος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Dam.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">50</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phlp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">in Mete.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17.15</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ ἄ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">the Infinite,</b> as a first principle, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">203a3</span> </span>, etc.; esp. in the system of Anaximander, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.L.</span> <span class=\"